<title>USA: Toys R Us completes Baby Superstore buy.</title>
<headline>Toys R Us completes Baby Superstore buy.</headline>
<dateline>PARAMUS, N.J. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toys R Us Inc said on Monday it completed its previously announced purchase of Baby Superstore Inc in a tax-free exchange of stock valued at $376 million.</p>
<p>The merger adds 77 stores to Toys R Us.</p>
</text>
